822			// (worktreeSnapshotCacheable), so a working-tree entry and a committed-tree
823			// entry can have the same repo, tree and profile while carrying different
824			// provenance (W_WORKTREE_SNAPSHOT) — without this they would collide.
825			cache.Worktree == options.Worktree &&
